The '''Dragon Shortbow''' is an {{Epic}} [[Bow]]. It is automatically enchanted with {{Ench|Dragon Tracer V}}.

== Obtaining ==
A '''Dragon Shortbow''' has a chance of dropping from a {{MobSprite|Seer}} when the [[Lone Adventurer]] loses their '''Dragon Shortbow''' and the player has finished the {{NPCSprite|Pearl Dealer}} questline.

After returning the '''Dragon Shortbow''' to the [[Lone Adventurer]], the player can talk to the {{NPCSprite|Pearl Dealer}} to claim a '''Dragon Shortbow'''.

Once obtained, the player can purchase another '''Dragon Shortbow''' from {{NPCSprite|Rusty}} for {{c|100k}}.

